msgctxt "276\t336"
msgid "Eri-chan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "405\t513"
msgid "Go on. Show me how brave you can be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "795\t911"
msgid "Ayako-chan, I..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "912\t1038"
msgid ""
"It's okay. And...\\n"
"I'm sorry, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1085\t1211"
msgid ""
"Huh? Why are you\\n"
"apologizing, Ayako-chan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1221\t1301"
msgid "To be honest..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1311\t1449"
msgid ""
"I saw you take the money from my bag,\\n"
"Eri-chan. I knew it was you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1459\t1519"
msgid "Huh!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1568\t1632"
msgid "But even still..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1633\t1797"
msgid ""
"I couldn't bring myself to stop you.\\n"
"Even though it was the right thing to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1850\t2017"
msgid ""
"And now seeing what you're going through,\\n"
"I really wish I had."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2034\t2096"
msgid "If only I could take it back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2280\t2430"
msgid ""
"I'm supposed to be your sister,\\n"
"but I wasn't brave enough to stop you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2468\t2617"
msgid ""
"If I just had a little courage,\\n"
"none of this would ever have happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2670\t2755"
msgid "So... I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2768\t2865"
msgid "Will you ever forgive me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2933\t3042"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, too!\\n"
"I'm so sorry!"
msgstr ""